  unitName: "Wendy Marvell (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 850647
  unitNumber: 8465
  description: Wendy is a Sky Dragon Slayer who draws her power from the air around
    her. She excels at healing magic, and is able to cure even wounds inflicted by
    a dragon. After the Nirvana incident, Wendy became a member of Fairy Tail.Although
    she has a shy personality, Wendy has grown familiar with her guildmates and enjoys
    her time with them.
  summonDesc: I...don't really know what it is to have fun in battle...but, this
    is for my guild, so I'm going to do everything I can!
  fusionDesc: Even I can fight at full strength at times like these!
